# --- Agent scaffolding -------------------------------------------------------
# Work orders, start prompts, audits and proposals produced during agent runs.
# Kept on disk for reference; never committed. Note this does NOT untrack the
# agent docs already in the repo (AGENT_WORKFLOW.md, PROMPT_LEDGER.md,
# DEVIATION_LOG.md, WO_UI_*.md, AUDIT_REPORT.md, PHASE19_RUN_LOG.md) — those
# stay tracked by design.
/PROMPT_*.md
/PROMPT_*.txt
/WO_L*.md
/WO_PHASE*.md
/WO_IDE_*.md
/WO_UX_*.md
/WO_UX_*.txt
/AUDIT_*.md
!/AUDIT_REPORT.md
/ASSESSMENT_*.md
/PROPOSAL_*.md
/PHASE*_PLAN_*.md
/walkthrough.md

